Z||000000||Rodrv6||04-07-2001||01:49 PM||||Since there have been a few instances lately of folks voicing dissatisfaction with some vendors, I thought it might be nice to recognize one who has been a pleasure to deal with.<BR>I just recieved a box of parts I ordered from Rodney Dickman.  Once again the stuff showed up sooner than I expected, it is well packaged, and the price is right.  I've placed a few orders with him over the last several months and have NEVER had the slightest complaint!  Great job, Rodney  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  84 SE, 330,000 miles and counting, 88 GT, not nearly as many miles :)||||reg||10
